 "notes": [
  "Posted 3 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'starting': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost ('Endor ops.'), Endor, Endor: Landing Platform, Endor: Bunker, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Decree, You Cannot Hide Forever and Imperial Arrest Order ('IAO'); these count toward the 60. Three Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so none is set.",
  "Posted 'alter/combo' dested Alter & Collateral Damage (the strategy says 'Alter combo ... collaborate damage'); 'ghkk/ combo' dested Ghhhk & Those Rebels Won't Escape Us.",
  "Posted 'endor system', 'landing platform', 'bunker', 'yayin docking bay', 'hoth docking bay', 'endor back door' and 'vibro-ax' dested the Dark pages (Endor, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Endor: Bunker, Yavin 4: Docking Bay, Hoth: Echo Docking Bay, Endor: Back Door, Vibro-Ax).",
  "Posted 'maul' dested Darth Maul (Tatooine; the card titled Maul is a later Virtual card); 'vader' dested Darth Vader; 'mara' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'mara's stick'/'vaders stick' dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber / Vader's Lightsaber; 'sonova' dested Snoova; 'colonel davod' dested Colonel Davod Jon; 'dengar with blaster' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'dr evazan & ponda' dested Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba.",
  "'executor (the good one)' does not say which Executor (Executor from Dagobah or Flagship Executor from Death Star II); it is printed as posted.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
